          "name": "How do I choose the best facade company in India?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Verify registration, inspect completed projects, visit the factory, read the warranty, check engineering, approve a mock-up, link payments to milestones, lock the scope and speak to past clients. Choose on proof, not promises."
